<title>UK: IRA gave coded warning before blast-BBC.</title>
<headline>IRA gave coded warning before blast-BBC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Irish Republican Army gave a coded warning to police before two bombs exploded in the northwestern town of Wilmslow early on Wednesday, the BBC reported.</p>
</text>
